# Exclusion-based: the build context is the repository root, so everything an image does not
# need stays out. The Dockerfiles copy only what they name (props, project files, src/).
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vs/
.idea/
.env
.env.*
**/*.user
**/TestResults/
coverage/
tests/
docs/
k6/
scripts/
flyio/
*.md
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
